# Wave T48 (Shardfall kit): starcrate — a heavy star-marked shipping crate: planked wood, iron bands, the star-sign company's mark painted on the face (the HQ sign's own words made dressing: 'Deliveries come and go at all hours; questions do not'), seated at the HQ landing's west shoulder (3,13) and at warehouse hand BRIN's shoulder (7,12) — the painting's stacks of heavy star-marked crates at the HQ dock, at the two seats the backend leaves open. Fully opaque: the town grass is baked in (measured #17821b, tg-veilstone's rendered flat, #174c1b speckle). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T48-SHARDFALL-PLAN.md §5.)
